WEBVTT

04:25.760 --> 04:28.000
I'll go to the flower shops
at Xiangzhang Road Metro Station.

04:28.080 --> 04:30.880
I heard many flower shops
got their goods from there.

04:31.800 --> 04:34.280
Okay. Tell me if you find anything.

04:39.040 --> 04:41.040
Then I'll hang up. Bye.

04:45.680 --> 04:46.920
You're up.

04:53.840 --> 04:55.080
Breakfast is ready.

04:55.680 --> 04:56.680
Let's eat.

05:09.400 --> 05:10.760
It's your favorite.

05:11.360 --> 05:14.000
Chicken cutlet sandwich with fried egg.

05:39.640 --> 05:40.680
You're welcome.

05:40.760 --> 05:41.680
Just eat.

05:57.120 --> 05:59.720
After we finish breakfast,
I'll look for the old lady.

05:59.800 --> 06:02.440
Wait for me at home.
I'll keep you informed.

06:09.920 --> 06:11.440
I'm going with you.

06:13.640 --> 06:15.320
I can handle it.

06:15.400 --> 06:16.720
Just rest at home.

06:19.680 --> 06:20.760
Okay.

06:26.120 --> 06:29.680
Are you worried that if we get separated,

06:29.760 --> 06:31.080
you won't be able to find me?

06:34.200 --> 06:35.880
I forgot the juice I made.

07:07.560 --> 07:09.920
If you get bored, you can watch TV shows

07:10.000 --> 07:11.240
and play games.

07:18.400 --> 07:19.800
Okay. I'm leaving.

07:19.880 --> 07:21.360
Text me if you need anything.

07:46.960 --> 07:47.840
Love you too.

07:52.160 --> 07:53.080
By the way,

07:54.280 --> 07:56.520
remember to bring your phone
wherever you go.

07:56.600 --> 07:58.080
Text me if anything happens.

08:41.120 --> 08:41.960
TBC

08:49.840 --> 08:51.840
Yes, please help me check it.

08:51.920 --> 08:54.120
Okay. Waiting for your reply.

08:54.200 --> 08:56.240
Here, confirm the data here.

08:56.320 --> 08:58.600
And make the font larger
for our client to read.

08:58.680 --> 09:00.640
Okay, I'll finish it in the afternoon.

09:03.480 --> 09:04.840
Guys, pay attention.

09:04.920 --> 09:06.280
Su Chengcheng is taking days off.

09:06.360 --> 09:08.680
I need you to share part of her work.

09:11.880 --> 09:13.160
What happened to her?

09:13.240 --> 09:15.880
It's not serious.
She'll be back in a few days.

09:17.440 --> 09:18.480
Go ahead.

09:52.960 --> 09:54.680
DEAR YUAN

10:05.680 --> 10:06.520
Hello.

10:06.600 --> 10:07.480
Hello, Chengcheng.

10:07.560 --> 10:09.120
Gu Yu told me you took days off.

10:09.200 --> 10:10.200
What happened?

10:11.520 --> 10:14.280
- I'm fine. The filter…
- Hello, Chengcheng.

10:15.880 --> 10:17.160
has a problem.

10:17.240 --> 10:18.200
Hello?

10:21.640 --> 10:22.600
Hello, Chengcheng.

10:23.440 --> 10:24.920
Can you hear me?

10:25.800 --> 10:27.200
I can't hear you.

10:28.440 --> 10:29.640
Hello.

10:42.640 --> 10:43.960
I'm fine.

10:47.120 --> 10:47.800
DEAR CHENG

10:47.880 --> 10:49.120
Can't talk right now.

10:51.560 --> 10:53.160
Glad to know you're fine.

10:54.640 --> 10:56.520
In what circumstances

10:56.600 --> 10:58.400
do you think
someone will become invisible?

10:59.240 --> 11:00.360
DEAR CHENG

11:02.480 --> 11:05.400
Ghost in My Office
is an out-of-body experience.

11:05.480 --> 11:08.160
Invisible Man is due to unknown medicine.

11:08.240 --> 11:11.360
In the comics, the character
ate the invisible fruit by accident.

11:21.200 --> 11:24.040
If something like this
happens to your characters,

11:24.120 --> 11:25.400
what will you do?

11:25.480 --> 11:27.320
DEAR CHENG

11:28.440 --> 11:31.440
Humans fear consequences,
while bodhisattva fears causes.

11:32.120 --> 11:33.920
If you want to solve a problem,

11:34.000 --> 11:36.080
you need to face the cause you created.

11:39.880 --> 11:43.680
If you want to solve a problem,

11:43.760 --> 11:47.600
you need to face the cause you created.

11:54.200 --> 11:56.680
Why are you asking
such a strange question?

11:56.760 --> 11:58.240
What happened?

12:13.240 --> 12:14.200
DEAR CHENG

12:14.280 --> 12:15.160
Something happened.

12:15.240 --> 12:16.480
I need to face it right now.

12:38.120 --> 12:42.000
SHANGZHI ROAD

12:45.560 --> 12:47.880
THE DRIVER IS ARRIVING

12:50.680 --> 12:52.360
DIDI RIDE-HAILING

12:58.960 --> 13:00.320
Sir, please open the door.

13:22.120 --> 13:23.280
The address…

13:24.240 --> 13:25.320
Yes, it's here.

13:27.240 --> 13:30.640
Did something urgent happen?

13:32.960 --> 13:34.120
Canceled?

13:34.800 --> 13:35.640
Okay.

14:17.000 --> 14:19.560
ALL-ELECTRIC DRIVE
ENERGY-SAVING & ECO-FRIENDLY

14:24.440 --> 14:25.640
Wait a minute!

14:27.000 --> 14:28.120
Wait a minute!

14:33.880 --> 14:35.560
Why is it stuck?

14:42.760 --> 14:43.480
TRANSACTION COMPLETED

14:43.560 --> 14:44.920
Transaction completed.

15:17.120 --> 15:19.240
So, this is the world
of an invisible person.

15:20.400 --> 15:21.880
No one can see you.

15:22.640 --> 15:23.600
Your pain,

15:24.120 --> 15:25.000
injury,

15:25.680 --> 15:26.800
and sorrow

15:27.600 --> 15:29.520
are nothing but a solo mime.

15:36.360 --> 15:38.640
I don't know the person.

15:39.640 --> 15:40.680
Please think carefully.

15:41.960 --> 15:43.280
For better bookkeeping,

15:43.360 --> 15:46.840
we will record
every purchaser's detailed information.

15:46.920 --> 15:49.480
I've checked the names one by one.

15:50.080 --> 15:51.480
There's no such a person.

15:52.080 --> 15:53.960
Could it be that you forgot it?

15:54.040 --> 15:56.920
You said she's a deaf old lady.

15:57.000 --> 15:57.840
Yes.

15:59.080 --> 16:01.680
She's old and deaf.

16:01.760 --> 16:03.760
I wouldn't forget such a person.

16:05.680 --> 16:08.160
There are other flower shops
doing wholesale business.

16:08.240 --> 16:10.440
Maybe I can take you there.

16:11.000 --> 16:13.600
I've asked all of them.
You're the last one.

16:14.200 --> 16:16.240
Sorry, I couldn't help you.

16:17.240 --> 16:18.720
It's okay. Sorry for the trouble.

16:18.800 --> 16:19.880
Thanks.

16:22.880 --> 16:24.080
Sir.

16:26.080 --> 16:28.040
Let's exchange our numbers.

16:28.120 --> 16:30.800
I'm familiar with this area.
I'll keep an eye on it.

16:30.880 --> 16:33.240
If she shows up, I'll tell you.

16:34.680 --> 16:35.480
Scan this code.

16:35.560 --> 16:36.600
YANZHI FLOWER

16:36.680 --> 16:37.840
Thank you.

16:52.040 --> 16:53.720
The wind is so strange.

17:11.960 --> 17:14.079
SAFE JOURNEY

17:40.240 --> 17:45.240
FANCHENG FLOWER & BIRD MARKET, YANZHI

17:47.200 --> 17:49.760
Sir, you haven't scanned my code.

17:51.480 --> 17:54.040
If I can't find it elsewhere,
I'll come back.

17:54.120 --> 17:54.960
Thanks.

18:24.400 --> 18:27.720
SAFE JOURNEY

18:52.880 --> 18:53.760
Thanks.

18:55.600 --> 18:57.720
Chengcheng, why did you come?

19:17.520 --> 19:19.600
I want to face it and solve it myself.

19:19.680 --> 19:21.600
I don't want to wait at home.

19:31.920 --> 19:32.800
Sorry.

19:33.640 --> 19:34.840
It's my fault.

19:36.800 --> 19:38.600
Let's figure it out together.

19:58.600 --> 19:59.800
Hello.

20:02.240 --> 20:04.360
Okay. I'm coming.

20:15.400 --> 20:18.040
Check this.
Is this the person you're looking for?

20:18.120 --> 20:19.880
HOUSEHOLD REGISTRATION INFORMATION
LIU XIANGPING

20:20.600 --> 20:22.600
Yes, it's her.

20:25.440 --> 20:26.880
Yes, it's her.

20:27.920 --> 20:28.800
Are you sure?

20:29.440 --> 20:30.520
Yes.

20:30.600 --> 20:33.080
I remember clearly
that she gave me the filter bracelet.

20:35.520 --> 20:36.360
Yes.

20:38.080 --> 20:40.360
She often came to our area

20:40.440 --> 20:42.400
and sold small stuff.

20:42.480 --> 20:43.800
But…

20:46.840 --> 20:47.680
What's wrong?

20:53.160 --> 20:55.400
She died of disease two years ago.

20:59.920 --> 21:02.560
DEATH CERTIFICATE, LIU XIANGPING

21:06.920 --> 21:09.160
DEATH CERTIFICATE, LIU XIANGPING

21:19.040 --> 21:20.040
Thanks, Officer.

21:38.440 --> 21:41.520
If she passed away two years ago,

21:41.600 --> 21:43.480
who could the person I met be?

21:48.760 --> 21:50.640
You can use the filter to become Fang Jin,

21:51.560 --> 21:53.920
so someone else can also use it
to become the old lady.

21:54.960 --> 21:56.680
The person who gave it to me

21:57.200 --> 21:58.760
might be a man,

21:58.840 --> 22:00.320
a woman,

22:00.400 --> 22:02.280
an old lady,

22:02.360 --> 22:04.360
or a young girl.

22:06.840 --> 22:08.480
She can be anyone.

22:09.120 --> 22:11.760
But I don't even know what she looks like.

22:11.840 --> 22:13.320
Where can I find her?

22:27.600 --> 22:29.440
It's okay if we can't find her.

22:29.520 --> 22:30.680
We've got the stuff.

22:32.000 --> 22:34.960
We can study the object
to solve the problem.

22:52.440 --> 22:54.840
The filter product you mentioned

22:54.920 --> 22:58.200
can not only transform one's appearance
through visual deception

22:58.280 --> 23:01.280
but also block someone
and make them invisible.

23:01.360 --> 23:02.760
It's feasible in theory,

23:02.840 --> 23:05.640
but in fact,
there are many problems to be solved.

23:06.480 --> 23:07.560
As far as I know,

23:07.640 --> 23:10.880
there's no such product
throughout the world right now.

23:10.960 --> 23:13.560
However, I'm not sure

23:13.640 --> 23:16.560
if a private-funded lab
has similar products.

23:16.640 --> 23:19.120
Okay. Thank you, Professor He.

23:19.720 --> 23:20.960
You're welcome.

23:21.040 --> 23:22.720
You can ask me anything.

23:27.040 --> 23:29.680
I'll ask my friends and classmates abroad.

23:29.760 --> 23:31.080
Maybe I can find something.

23:31.160 --> 23:33.400
What labs have the ability to produce it?

23:48.240 --> 23:51.560
I have an idea. It's simple but effective.

23:53.360 --> 23:54.240
What is it?

23:58.480 --> 24:00.080
My friend is on vacation right now.

24:00.160 --> 24:01.440
I'll give you the password.

24:01.520 --> 24:03.640
Go there with Su Chengcheng. I'm coming.

24:03.720 --> 24:04.760
Okay.

24:11.120 --> 24:12.400
Tell me the truth.

24:12.480 --> 24:13.600
Why is she taking days off?

24:13.680 --> 24:15.800
What problems does she need to solve?

24:20.080 --> 24:21.800
I'll take you to see her right now.

24:22.680 --> 24:24.160
What exactly happened?

24:24.240 --> 24:25.400
I'll tell you later.

24:57.400 --> 24:58.280
How's it going?

24:59.000 --> 25:01.440
What material is this?

25:01.520 --> 25:03.120
There's not a single scratch.

25:03.200 --> 25:04.040
Chengcheng.

25:24.000 --> 25:25.960
Not a single scratch.

25:33.720 --> 25:35.720
As for the common metals
used to make bracelets,

25:36.280 --> 25:38.400
silver's hardness is between 2.5 and four,

25:38.480 --> 25:39.960
and gold's hardness
is between 2.5 and three.

25:40.560 --> 25:42.760
The hardness of the filter material
is probably seven.

25:43.960 --> 25:47.240
Only professionals can cut it
with a cutter.

25:47.320 --> 25:48.160
But…

25:49.000 --> 25:50.880
But it's on your wrist.

25:50.960 --> 25:53.600
Even if we can see it,
we need to be very careful.

25:53.680 --> 25:55.160
Otherwise, your hand might get hurt.

25:55.240 --> 25:56.640
We shouldn't do it unless

25:57.440 --> 25:58.680
we have no other choices.

25:58.760 --> 25:59.960
I get it.

26:00.680 --> 26:02.680
If we insist on cutting the bracelet

26:02.760 --> 26:04.760
when we can't see it,

26:04.840 --> 26:06.720
we might cut off my hand.

26:10.320 --> 26:11.240
Chengcheng.

26:13.520 --> 26:14.360
Chengcheng.

26:15.320 --> 26:16.720
Let's find another way.

26:22.960 --> 26:23.800
Chengcheng.

26:34.640 --> 26:36.880
The filter is more complicated
than the invisible fruit.

26:36.960 --> 26:39.920
It seems like it has created
a permanently sealed realm

26:40.000 --> 26:41.520
and trapped Chengcheng in there.

26:43.560 --> 26:46.840
In the 2D world,
no realms can be sealed forever.

26:46.920 --> 26:47.920
So, in the 3D world,

26:48.000 --> 26:50.320
no bracelets can be stuck
on one's hand forever.

26:50.840 --> 26:53.720
We should find the right way,
like the 2D characters.

26:53.800 --> 26:54.960
What way?

26:55.560 --> 26:58.480
I don't know, but there's got to be a way.

27:02.280 --> 27:03.480
Yuan is right.

27:03.560 --> 27:04.920
It's made of a special material.

27:05.000 --> 27:07.040
If we use force,
we might hurt Su Chengcheng.

27:07.640 --> 27:08.840
It can't be the right way.

27:09.520 --> 27:12.480
However, if we find the key to the lock,

27:12.560 --> 27:14.240
it might loosen and fall off.

27:24.720 --> 27:25.600
Chengcheng.

27:41.360 --> 27:42.280
Did you get hurt?

27:42.920 --> 27:44.400
What happened?

27:44.480 --> 27:45.520
Chengcheng.

27:46.320 --> 27:47.360
I can't see it.

27:48.640 --> 27:50.120
But you must be honest.

28:01.800 --> 28:02.640
Is it serious?

28:33.040 --> 28:34.920
Wait here. I'll buy the medicine.

28:47.560 --> 28:48.600
Cover yourself with this,

28:48.680 --> 28:50.920
so that others won't
sit on you by accident.

28:51.720 --> 28:53.400
Wait here. I'll be right back.

29:17.320 --> 29:19.200
Hello. It's 32.6 yuan in total.

29:19.280 --> 29:20.120
Okay.

29:23.000 --> 29:24.440
Please enter your passcode.

29:25.440 --> 29:27.440
My son said
he transferred the money to my phone.

29:27.520 --> 29:29.480
You just need to scan my code, right?

29:29.560 --> 29:31.280
Yes, I scanned it.

29:31.360 --> 29:33.720
You just need to enter the passcode.

29:33.800 --> 29:36.560
Pass… Is it the phone's passcode?

29:37.400 --> 29:38.400
No, it's not.

29:42.240 --> 29:43.440
- Tomboy!
- You're a tomboy!

29:43.520 --> 29:45.280
- You're a tomboy!
- You're a tomboy!

29:45.360 --> 29:47.160
- You're a tomboy!
- Tomboy!

29:47.240 --> 29:49.080
You lost to a girl!

29:49.160 --> 29:51.000
- So what?
- You're a tomboy!

29:51.080 --> 29:55.480
Big strength! Tomboy!

29:55.560 --> 29:57.920
Big strength! Tomboy!

29:58.000 --> 29:59.120
- Big strength!
- Tomboy!

29:59.200 --> 30:01.360
- Tomboy, don't run.
- Tomboy, you're a tomboy.

30:01.440 --> 30:03.480
Do you think you can escape?

30:03.560 --> 30:05.320
- Tomboy.
- Yes, tomboy.

30:05.400 --> 30:07.160
I'm a girl! You lost!

30:07.240 --> 30:09.120
- We lost. So what?
- So what if you are a girl?

30:09.200 --> 30:10.320
Aren't you a tomboy?

30:10.400 --> 30:11.240
Tom…

30:26.160 --> 30:27.000
It hurts!

30:28.600 --> 30:31.600
Don't be so rude. Be friendly.

30:31.680 --> 30:33.200
Wh-What's wrong?

30:33.280 --> 30:34.960
Monster.

30:37.640 --> 30:38.680
Where is the monster?

30:39.920 --> 30:43.200
Who… Who flicked my forehead?

30:43.280 --> 30:44.280
Show up!

30:45.480 --> 30:46.520
- It hurts!
- Who is it?

30:48.040 --> 30:49.240
Is there really a monster?

30:49.320 --> 30:50.640
Run!

31:36.040 --> 31:38.440
BE YOURSELF

31:42.320 --> 31:43.920
Are you a fairy?

31:48.520 --> 31:50.640
Ms. Fairy, thank you
for chasing them away.

31:50.720 --> 31:52.280
If they laugh at me again,

31:52.360 --> 31:54.160
I'll be brave and chase them away.

31:55.640 --> 31:57.440
There are many kinds of beauty.

31:57.520 --> 32:00.960
You're healthy and strong.
You're beautiful.

32:02.200 --> 32:04.000
Ms. Fairy, I have to go home.

32:04.080 --> 32:05.160
Bye!

32:38.800 --> 32:39.800
- Okay, thanks.
- Okay.

32:48.120 --> 32:49.520
Sorry for the wait.

32:49.600 --> 32:51.000
Give me your hand. I'll use the medicine.

33:01.320 --> 33:02.400
Chengcheng?

33:03.000 --> 33:03.840
Chengcheng?

33:06.120 --> 33:07.040
Chengcheng?

33:08.760 --> 33:09.600
Chengcheng?

33:12.560 --> 33:13.400
Chengcheng!

33:55.040 --> 33:56.160
Chengcheng!

34:02.760 --> 34:03.600
Chengcheng!

34:20.199 --> 34:21.920
She knew I was at the pharmacy.

34:22.000 --> 34:23.639
She wouldn't leave without saying a word.

34:24.480 --> 34:26.000
She must be around.

34:38.199 --> 34:39.600
Her phone is not turned off.

34:39.679 --> 34:40.760
It still has power.

34:44.360 --> 34:45.400
What happened?

34:46.120 --> 34:47.600
She's still around

34:47.679 --> 34:48.800
but won't answer me

34:49.760 --> 34:50.719
or take my calls.

34:53.679 --> 34:55.800
She's unconscious and can't hear me.

34:55.880 --> 34:57.320
Even if she hears me, she can't move

34:58.560 --> 34:59.680
or answer me.

35:26.240 --> 35:27.560
It's an optical illusion.

35:29.000 --> 35:30.320
She must be around.

35:30.920 --> 35:32.520
You're a tetrachromat

35:32.600 --> 35:35.560
who can see 100 times
more colors than others do,

35:35.640 --> 35:37.360
and you're sensitive to light.

35:37.440 --> 35:40.280
You must protect your eyes.

37:24.960 --> 37:26.280
Are you crazy?

37:26.360 --> 37:27.960
You can die, but don't harm others.

37:29.040 --> 37:30.120
Psycho.

37:35.560 --> 37:36.400
Chengcheng.

37:37.400 --> 37:38.240
Chengcheng!

37:40.080 --> 37:41.240
Chengcheng!

37:41.320 --> 37:42.520
Chengcheng!

37:42.600 --> 37:43.760
Su Chengcheng!

37:44.840 --> 37:48.440
Chengcheng! Chengcheng…

37:48.520 --> 37:50.480
Don't worry. I'm okay.

37:51.640 --> 37:52.600
It's okay.

37:57.680 --> 37:58.520
It's okay.

38:09.280 --> 38:10.280
I'm fine.

38:11.560 --> 38:12.400
Don't worry.

38:18.280 --> 38:19.200
It's okay.

38:27.000 --> 38:28.280
I was freaked out.

38:49.240 --> 38:53.680
Do you think
love is related to appearance?

39:00.280 --> 39:02.960
There's one thing I can't figure out.

39:04.760 --> 39:05.680
What?

39:06.760 --> 39:09.040
Humans evolved from animals.

39:09.120 --> 39:10.760
According to the laws of animals,

39:10.840 --> 39:13.280
males should try harder

39:13.360 --> 39:15.200
to look more charming.

39:17.800 --> 39:20.280
Why is it completely different for humans?

39:20.360 --> 39:22.920
Women need to wear makeup,

39:23.000 --> 39:23.960
high heels,

39:24.680 --> 39:26.480
jewels, and fancy clothes

39:26.560 --> 39:29.120
to make them more beautiful.

39:31.960 --> 39:33.040
Perhaps it's because

39:33.120 --> 39:35.600
women evolved faster than men

39:35.680 --> 39:37.160
and have seen through the essence of love.

39:37.760 --> 39:41.040
Maybe human's love and appearance

39:41.120 --> 39:43.560
are related and not related
at the same time.

39:51.520 --> 39:53.560
Humans are just one species in the planet.

39:54.240 --> 39:56.840
However, we not only look up to the sky

39:56.920 --> 39:58.400
but explore the space

39:58.480 --> 40:03.000
and even fly to another planet.

40:04.840 --> 40:07.520
Due to the nature of animals,
we will be attracted

40:08.600 --> 40:09.760
by others' appearance.

40:09.840 --> 40:10.680
However,

40:11.600 --> 40:13.080
love is the resonance between souls.

40:13.880 --> 40:14.840
It's beyond appearance.

40:19.440 --> 40:20.360
What about you?

40:21.960 --> 40:23.040
How far have you evolved?

40:28.600 --> 40:29.800
I need

40:32.080 --> 40:33.920
a lifetime to answer this question.

40:35.480 --> 40:36.680
Well,

40:37.280 --> 40:38.600
what about Tang Qi?

40:40.000 --> 40:42.720
Can his love transcend appearance?

40:44.720 --> 40:45.640
Are you worried about her?

40:58.960 --> 41:00.400
I trust my friend.

41:01.680 --> 41:04.520
You should also trust your friend.

41:23.000 --> 41:26.440
HARMONIOUS FAMILY, PROSPEROUS LIFE

41:33.880 --> 41:34.960
When Chengcheng is back,

41:35.040 --> 41:37.480
ask her to invite Yuan
and her boyfriend over for dinner.

41:38.080 --> 41:40.920
No need to wait.
Invite Yuan over this weekend.

41:41.880 --> 41:43.440
Yuan is shy.

41:43.520 --> 41:44.960
Chengcheng can keep her company.

41:45.040 --> 41:47.960
Qingli told me that her boyfriend
is Chengcheng's boss.

41:48.640 --> 41:49.960
More people, more fun.

41:51.400 --> 41:52.560
It's up to you.

41:55.600 --> 41:56.440
Who is it?

41:57.000 --> 41:57.920
Let me see.

42:00.080 --> 42:01.440
Coming.

42:06.200 --> 42:07.680
- Who are you?
- Hello, Mr. Su.

42:07.760 --> 42:09.800
We're Su Chengcheng's colleagues.

42:10.400 --> 42:11.640
Her colleagues?

42:11.720 --> 42:13.760
Come on in.

42:13.840 --> 42:14.760
Come in.

42:20.600 --> 42:21.480
Have some tea.

42:26.920 --> 42:28.880
Mr. Gu said Su Chengcheng was ill.

42:28.960 --> 42:29.960
We're here to visit her.

42:34.320 --> 42:36.920
She's not at home. Is she in the hospital?

42:38.880 --> 42:41.320
Are you here to visit her?

42:41.920 --> 42:42.840
Yes.

42:46.600 --> 42:47.640
Aren't you on a business trip?

42:47.720 --> 42:50.320
No one is on business trips right now.

43:02.320 --> 43:04.240
Are you in the same department?

43:06.240 --> 43:08.400
Yes?

43:08.480 --> 43:09.680
Yes.

43:54.960 --> 43:56.920
What's your favorite food?

43:57.000 --> 43:58.880
Ice cream is my favorite.

43:58.960 --> 44:01.720
Okay. I'll buy more for you, okay?

44:01.800 --> 44:02.840
Okay.

44:02.920 --> 44:04.400
They've been waiting. Hurry.

44:04.480 --> 44:05.360
Okay.

44:06.760 --> 44:08.880
In a TV series,

44:08.960 --> 44:11.320
invisible people can do
whatever they want.

44:12.440 --> 44:13.400
However,

44:14.280 --> 44:16.040
I can't even leave the house.

44:16.680 --> 44:20.200
People will be freaked out
when they see me eating potato chips.

44:24.400 --> 44:26.680
Come in. Put it in the middle of the yard.

44:26.760 --> 44:27.720
Chengcheng.

44:28.440 --> 44:29.960
Chengcheng.

44:30.040 --> 44:31.680
I ordered a going-out gift for you.

44:31.760 --> 44:32.960
- Here.
- Cheng…

44:39.440 --> 44:41.240
- Okay.
- Then we're leaving.

44:41.320 --> 44:42.760
- Thanks.
- You're welcome.

44:46.080 --> 44:47.280
Here.

44:48.520 --> 44:49.360
Thanks.

44:50.200 --> 44:52.360
What going-out gift?

45:01.040 --> 45:03.440
MOM

45:16.120 --> 45:18.440
I'm meeting with a client. What's wrong?

45:24.120 --> 45:25.760
Chengcheng, come back now.

45:25.840 --> 45:27.920
Your dad fell in the bathroom.

45:44.360 --> 45:45.520
Where's Su Chengcheng?

45:48.320 --> 45:49.480
She's in the car.

45:54.840 --> 45:55.680
This…

46:02.680 --> 46:05.960
The filter suddenly malfunctioned
and turned her invisible.

46:28.080 --> 46:29.200
Chengcheng?
